# Direct requirements for the Windows agent's python-3.cab — the human
# source of truth for what the CAB ships (formerly pipfiles/3/Pipfile).
#
# Keep this list unpinned: the resolved requirements-windows.txt is the pin,
# regenerated with `bazel run //agents/modules/windows:requirements_windows`.
# Version bounds belong in constraints-windows.txt.

colorama  # Windows has to have some color output
pyyaml  # to support the agent config
certifi  # jolokia
chardet  # jolokia
idna  # jolokia
requests[socks]  # jolokia, cmk_update_agent
urllib3  # jolokia
cryptography  # cmk_update_agent
pywin32  # logwatch
# The historic Windows build seeded pip into the CAB's .venv (via
# virtualenv) and upgraded the base interpreter's pip (via pipenv), so
# customers can extend the agent's Python with `.venv\Scripts\pip install`.
# Keep that surface.
pip
